$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum -n 'First try'
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: "First try" is not a pull request name - use first-try

$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum -n first-try
submitted first-try: 1 commit, 4 files, from fix-sum into main
todos: fix-the-sum
the pull request is not committed - to share it, run: git add -A .todoer/prs/first-try && git commit -m "todoer: submit first-try" -- .todoer/prs/first-try

$ todoer pr close first-try
closed first-try
the todos stay: fix-the-sum
not committed - to share the close, run: git add -A .todoer/prs/first-try && git commit -m "todoer: close first-try" -- .todoer/prs/first-try

$ git status --short && ls .todoer
 D .todoer/prs/first-try/pr.diff
 D .todoer/prs/first-try/pr.md
 D .todoer/prs/first-try/pr.patch
prs
todos

$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum -n second-try
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: fix-sum has changes that are not committed in <tmp>/fix-sum: notes.txt - commit them first

$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum -n second-try
submitted second-try: 1 commit, 4 files, from fix-sum into main
todos: fix-the-sum
the pull request is not committed - to share it, run: git add -A .todoer/prs/second-try && git commit -m "todoer: submit second-try" -- .todoer/prs/second-try

$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum-2 -n second-try
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: main already has the pull request second-try - use -n second-try --update to replace it, or another -n to make a new pull request

$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum-2 -n nope --update
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: main has no pull request nope - remove --update to make it. The open pull requests on main: second-try

$ todoer pr submit --branch fix-sum-2 -n second-try --update -m 'From a new branch.'
updated second-try: 1 commit, 4 files, from fix-sum-2 into main
todos: fix-the-sum
the pull request is not committed - to share it, run: git add -A .todoer/prs/second-try && git commit -m "todoer: update second-try" -- .todoer/prs/second-try

$ todoer pr ls [cwd: fix-sum]
no open pull requests

$ todoer pr ls && git log --format=%s -1 && git status --short
second-try  no comments  me@example.com
Update second-try

$ todoer pr apply second-try --merge
merged second-try into main
done: fix-the-sum
the merge is staged and not committed - to commit it, run: git commit -m "todoer: merge second-try"

$ git log --format=%s -1 && git status --short && cat src/app.rs
Update second-try
D  .todoer/prs/second-try/pr.diff
D  .todoer/prs/second-try/pr.md
D  .todoer/prs/second-try/pr.patch
D  .todoer/todos/fix-the-sum.md
M  docs/guide.md
 M notes.txt
M  src/app.rs
R  src/old.rs -> src/lib.rs
fn main() {
    let a = 1;
    let b = 3;
    println!("{}", a + b);
}

$ todoer pr apply second-try --merge
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: the patch does not apply on main - nothing changed. To update the pull request, make a new branch from main, run todoer pr apply second-try there, resolve the conflicts and commit, then run todoer pr submit --branch <the new branch> -n second-try --update on main:
Applied patch to 'src/app.rs' with conflicts.

$ git log --format=%s -1 && git status --short
change app on main

$ todoer pr comment second-try 'Add a test.'
added the comment c1 on the pull request in second-try
the review is not committed - when it is done, run: git add .todoer/prs/second-try/review.md && git commit -m "Review second-try" -- .todoer/prs/second-try/review.md

$ todoer pr apply second-try --merge
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: second-try has the unresolved comments c1 - the author must do what they ask, then run todoer pr submit --branch <the branch of the work> -n second-try --update on main

$ todoer pr apply second-try --merge --no-commit
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: unknown option --no-commit for "todoer pr apply" - run todoer pr apply --help

$ todoer pr close second-try && git status --short && todoer pr ls
closed second-try
the todos stay: fix-the-sum
not committed - to share the close, run: git add -A .todoer/prs/second-try && git commit -m "todoer: close second-try" -- .todoer/prs/second-try
 D .todoer/prs/second-try/pr.diff
 D .todoer/prs/second-try/pr.md
 D .todoer/prs/second-try/pr.patch
no open pull requests

